   "changeReason": "D-033 (Shawn 2026-10-29: \"右下颚连接处的圈掉了 … 设计一个圆圈 通过螺丝固定在右下颚上\", \"能不能直接一个件搞定\", \"有螺丝固定就不用那个特别薄的挡板了吧\"): one-piece capped ring, OD 14.0, bore 10.5, 2.1 mm tall, 1.5 mm bottom with a dia 1.6 pilot, no flange. On the boss cut back 2.0 mm it ends where the old ring ended (y -37.5), so the jaw springs in with the usual bend; one M2 x 8 from outside the arm (hole drilled to 2.5) gives 1.5 mm of thread in the bottom. Clear of the lower shell 0.3 mm and the jaw support 0.49 mm, as the old sleeve. Two copies: one spare.",
